[ti:Din Mein Sarpanch]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:02.37]Pinki… Pinki… maut ka samaan,
[00:05.60]Din mein sarpanch… raat shaitaan…
[00:08.83]Khoon bhi mera… kanoon bhi mera,
[00:12.06]Chaudharahat pe mera hai raaj…
[00:15.29]Ghaghra laal… chaandni raat,
[00:18.51]Aankhon mein jalta andhera saath…
[00:21.74]Raat meri hai… shikar mera,
[00:24.97]Zindagi pe bhi adhikaar mera…
